cess our  waste wherever possible and reintroduce  it into the economy it's been proved a  thousand times that it's possible this  game you just have to produce it with  the right quality and then everyone  around the world can start doing it  these blocks made of 100% recycled  material have been set aside to build an  Information Center for visitors face  wants to teach those visitors from  around the world how to follow his  example  you
 

